Add Your Own Security Rules
Create a new file in aisec_scanner/rules/:

python
# my_custom_rule.py
def check_my_vulnerability(target_path):
    # Your logic here
    return [
        {
            "type": "Custom Vulnerability",
            "file": "example.py",
            "line": 42,
            "description": "Description of the issue",
            "remediation": "How to fix it"
        }
    ]
Then import and call it in scanner.py.
